llm_text:
Certainly Agree

@67351, the enchantment found in linking starry skies with life trajectories appeals deeply to the romantic sensibilities many harbor toward cosmos-based narratives, including myself. Nevertheless, adhering strictly to the tenets of rigorous science demands acknowledgment of a gap wide enough to drive a tractor trailer unit between astrology's theoretical constructs and evidenced realities.

As much as the poetic license granted to interpretations of natal charts holds emotional resonance, what ultimately stands testifies to observable phenomena. Personality emerges sculpted

